    - target: {fileID: 6794638779498270385, guid: 416000cd0d4d37a4da13715880ca182a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogueData.memory
      value: He moved to Pearl Port as a teenager. He remembers finding a love for
        fashion as a teenager, which he shares in his store. He has never met the
        player before.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6794638779498270385, guid: 416000cd0d4d37a4da13715880ca182a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogueData.beliefs
      value: Life is a game of power and influence. Also, people will do whatever
        he wants them to do if he is charming enough.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6794638779498270385, guid: 416000cd0d4d37a4da13715880ca182a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogueData.backstory
      value: He moved to Pearl Port as a teenager. He found that life was easier
        if he manipulated people into doing what he wanted them to. He was bullied
        as a child, so he learned to be tough and suave.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6794638779498270385, guid: 416000cd0d4d37a4da13715880ca182a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogueData.personality
      value: flamboyant, charming, witty, dramatic, and pretty selfish.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6794638779498270385, guid: 416000cd0d4d37a4da13715880ca182a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogueData.speakingStyle
      value: Slow, long, dramatic speech. A bit condescending like he knows better.
        Uses a lot of metaphors and similes.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6794638779498270385, guid: 416000cd0d4d37a4da13715880ca182a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogueData.knowledgeScope
      value: Fashion, How to read people.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
